3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIsUxdJyt72kbBTllcvussHVRx9bIdfs4AIOePlnNekaQ&oe=6AA172F8"}, "display_name": "SwordTrip", "keywords": ["Chinese", "Sword", "Fight", "Fighting", "SwordTrip"], "long_description": "Join our Discord: https://discord.gg/QTWG3hmeHa\n\n# **SwordTrip**: A Chinese-style Action Roguelite VR Game  \n\nUnlock powerful abilities through stage rewards, and utilize a skill system specifically designed for VR interaction to build your preferred skill combinations. Experience overwhelming power to defeat your enemies!  \n\n**MR Mode Gameplay**: Become a hero in mixed reality, blending the real and virtual worlds!  \n{1613065892646065}\n\n**A More Exciting Combat System**: Enjoy the thrill of sword clashes and slashes without the frustration of weapons getting stuck.  \n{1775385619886463}\n\n**Skill System**: A VR-interaction-based skill system designed to amaze you with every ability!  \n{619673813720723}\n\n**Culturally Immersive Lobby**: Interact with Chinese culture in the game lobby, where you can write or paint with a calligraphy brush and customize the images on the lobby's display board.  \n\n\n\n\n{3839760072978508}", "short_description": "\"SwordTrip\" is a Chinese-style action roguelite VR game. Pick up your sword and grow stronger amidst the flashes of blades. Enjoy a unique skill system designed specifically for VR, allowing you to create and refine your favorite combat style."}]}, "developer_name": "OB Game", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1aqUBM25j91XePElIZTMvBoLXG9VoU-NWBpUfKJiDZDQ/edit#heading=h.tyrw81i0phpd", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "OB Game", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://linktr.ee/SwordTrip", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "4597815049684